etail":"","key":"creature/haref0","title":"Hare","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/human%20kania%20gang%20f11","title":"Killer","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/elementalicef11","title":"Snow elemental (medium)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/elementalicef9","title":"Snow elemental (small)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/human%20kania%20ranger%20f9","title":"Spy","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/driaddarka9","title":"Trained woodsfolk archer (Black Clan)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/driaddarkm9","title":"Trained woodsfolk magician (Black Clan)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/human%20kania%20gang%20f12","title":"Veteran brigand","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/doggreyf8","title":"Veteran dog","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/tigerwhitef10","title":"Veteran white tiger","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/trollbluef9","title":"Young blue troll","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/human%20kania%20gang%20f8","title":"Young brigand","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/human%20kania%20gang%20a8","title":"Young female brigand","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/q54k","title":"Abandoned mines","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/z12q2","title":"Arsenal key","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q47ak","title":"Avenging the Elder's kidnapper","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q53k","title":"Finding something valuable for Governor","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/qk10k","title":"Hostile Woodsfolk","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q51k","title":"Meeting Magician","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/z12q1","title":"Old opencast mines","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/q49k","title":"Taking Governor's collection","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"quest/z12q3","title":"Wormheads menace","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz11k","title":"City environs","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz14k","title":"Forbidden catacombs","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz13k","title":"Karansul's domain","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Abandoned mines</h1><p>A long time ago this area was famous for its mining industry. But they closed the mines when monsters and ogres started to appear and the area   deteriorated. Now the very few people who live in this territory do not feel they have any obligation to the city government.<br /></p><h2>The arrow and the Green Clan</h2><p>The arrow in the Snoop’s body appears to implicate the Woodsfolk. Sver explains that their markings identify a clan, while the governor discovers that the case containing similar arrows has been stolen from his collection. Two lines of inquiry now run alongside each other: the stolen collection and the Woodsfolk’s testimony. To approach <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a>, Zak first returns the Green Clan’s Sacred Flower after rescuing its keeper from the White Clan. Grey Leaf then asks for help with the kidnapped elder Khabburu and his captor. The clan ultimately identifies the murder arrow as a false attribution, even refusing to blame its enemies for it. When the clan moves, Zak receives access to its hidden route and new home. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]</p><h2>Karansul’s accounts and Baldie’s confession</h2><p><a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a> first lets Baldie’s name slip while boasting that mechanical traps are better than magical ones, then denies knowing anything useful. Tilvar mentions the merchant’s mechanical grinder and the disruption caused when it breaks. Sver knows how to turn these leads into pressure. Zak first delivers the hunter’s furs to a buyer outside the merchant’s monopoly. Sver then reveals Karansul’s hidden trade and unpaid taxes, pointing to the foreman’s accounts; he also recommends <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a> as a teacher. With the accounts as leverage, Zak learns where to find <a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Flein the Baldie</a>, called Baldie, and secures a meeting. Evidence from the stolen collection makes the thief confess: he killed the Snoop, planted the Woodsfolk arrow and worked for a cloaked employer who knew how to evade the governor’s magical traps. [7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14]</p><h2>Diera and the locked mines</h2><p>At the Green Clan’s new home, Grey Leaf describes the supposed man in grey as a white-haired woman. Zak identifies Diera, whose own traps protected the stolen collection. Her urgent warnings against the abandoned mines reinforce his suspicion. Tilvar explains that the governor holds the key. Karansul suggests winning it with a gold nugget and gives access to a dangerous pit, concealing the tigers that drove out its workers; Sver warns Zak of the trap. Zak obtains the nugget and presents it to the collector-governor as a business prospect. Valrasian releases the mine key, opening the way past Diera’s mercenaries. [15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals, event scripts and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/huber\">Valrasian</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/kapitan\">Tilvar</a> (briefing g43)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver the Trapper</a> (briefing t43)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing yc45)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing yc46)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a> (briefing yc47)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a> (briefing yc47_1)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver the Trapper</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing t43_1)</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver the Trapper</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing t44)</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a> (briefing mthief1)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing tr48)</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Flein the Baldie</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing tr49)</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Flein the Baldie</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing tr49_1)</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing tr43_1)</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/kapitan\">Tilvar</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing k44)</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing yc50)</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/magess\">Diera</a> (briefing mg43_1)</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/magess\">Diera</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing mg50)</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/kapitan\">Tilvar</a> (briefing k51)</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing tr52)</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver the Trapper</a> (briefing t52)</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/huber\">Valrasian</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Zak</a> (briefing g53)</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>Quest journal · Abandoned mines (quest q54k)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/ingos\">Ingos</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz11k\">City environs</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz13k\">Karansul's domain</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz14k\">Forbidden catacombs</a></td></tr></table><h2>Quests</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Quests</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/z12q1\">Old opencast mines</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/z12q2\">Arsenal key</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/z12q3\">Wormheads menace</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q53k\">Finding something valuable for Governor</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q47ak\">Avenging the Elder's kidnapper</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q49k\">Taking Governor's collection</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q51k\">Meeting Magician</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/qk10k\">Hostile Woodsfolk</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q54k\">Abandoned mines</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Flein the Baldie</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Grey Leaf</a